  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Frontend Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into the frontend now. The initial focus is on the component hierarchy, starting with a Header component. It will feature a tactical title bar with classification badge and live UTC information.\n\n\n**Defining Map Components**\n\nI\'ve moved on to designing the TacticalMap component now. I am integrating high-performance Leaflet with custom basemaps like CartoDB dark, Esri World Imagery, OpenTopoMap, and OpenStreetMap. RainViewer precipitation radar will also be integrated. Furthermore, I\'m working on custom SVG markers for aircraft with true track, altitude color, and velocity vectors. I\'m also planning markers for satellites with real-time ground tracks, and markers for earthquakes with magnitude and depth considerations.\n\n\n**Expanding Map Layer Control**\n\nI\'m now focusing on layer controls for the map. I\'m adding features like filter sliders for earthquake magnitude and flight altitudes. I\'m also including a satellite group selector and refresh triggers for the data. I\'m aiming for a collapsible panel that will house multiple layer toggles, plus live record counts and opacity controls.\n\n\n**Developing Object Detail View**\n\nI\'m now building the `ObjectDetailDrawer` component. Key features I\'m integrating include a strict data policy inspector displaying data freshness, source information, raw identifiers, and telemetry. A collapsible JSON inspector is planned for the raw payload.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_497796"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport { \\n  Globe, \\n  ShieldAlert, \\n  Activity, \\n  FileText, \\n  Cpu, \\n  Layers, \\n  RefreshCw, \\n  Radio, \\n  Sliders,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  AlertTriangle,\\n  Server\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { BaseMapType, SourceHealthEntry } from \'../types\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  baseMap: BaseMapType;\\n  setBaseMap: (bm: BaseMapType) => void;\\n  onOpenAudit: () => void;\\n  onOpenHealth: () => void;\\n  onOpenBriefing: () => void;\\n  onRefreshAll: () => void;\\n  isRefreshing: boolean;\\n  activeCounts: {\\n    flights: number;\\n    satellites: number;\\n    earthquakes: number;\\n    wildfires: number;\\n    news: number;\\n  };\\n  sourcesHealth: SourceHealthEntry[];\\n}\\n\\nexport function Header({\\n  baseMap,\\n  setBaseMap,\\n  onOpenAudit,\\n  onOpenHealth,\\n  onOpenBriefing,\\n  onRefreshAll,\\n  isRefreshing,\\n  activeCounts,\\n  sourcesHealth\\n}: HeaderProps) {\\n  const [timeUtc, setTimeUtc] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n  const [timeLocal, setTimeLocal] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const updateTime = () => {\\n      const now = new Date();\\n      setTimeUtc(now.toUTCString().replace(\'GMT\', \'ZULU\'));\\n      setTimeLocal(now.toLocaleTimeString());\\n    };\\n    updateTime();\\n    const timer = setInterval(updateTime, 1000);\\n    return () => clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const totalVerifiedLive = sourcesHealth.filter(s => s.status === \'VERIFIED LIVE\').length;\\n  const totalRequiresKey = sourcesHealth.filter(s => s.status === \'REQUIRES KEY\').length;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"h-16 bg-slate-950/95 border-b border-cyan-950/60 px-4 flex items-center justify-between z-30 select-none backdrop-blur-md\\\">\\n      {/* Brand & Platform Identity */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-950/50 border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)]\\\">\\n          <Globe className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-950 animate-ping\\\" />\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full ring-2 ring-slate-950\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-base font-bold tracking-wider font-[\'Chakra_Petch\'] text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n              GOD-VIEW-LAB\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 font-mono border border-cyan-500/30\\\">\\n                v2.0 GEOINT\\n              </span>\\n            </h1>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n              NO FAKE DATA VERIFIED\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <span>ALL DOMAINS LIVE TELEMETRY</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">\342\200\242</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-cyan-400/90\\\">{activeCounts.flights} Flights</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">\342\200\242</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-indigo-400/90\\\">{activeCounts.satellites} Sats</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">\342\200\242</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-amber-400/90\\\">{activeCounts.earthquakes} Quakes</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-slate-600\\\">\342\200\242</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-rose-400/90\\\">{activeCounts.wildfires} Fires</span>\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Center: Real-Time Military / UTC Clock */}\\n      <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs shadow-inner\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n          <Radio className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 text-[10px]\\\">TIME UTC:</span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-cyan-300 font-medium tracking-wide\\\">{timeUtc || \'SYNCING...\'}</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div className=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-slate-800\\\" />\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n          <Activity className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-400 text-[10px]\\\">LOCAL:</span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-200\\\">{timeLocal || \'--:--:--\'}</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div className=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-slate-800\\\" />\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[10px]\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">FEEDS:</span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-emerald-400 font-semibold\\\">{totalVerifiedLive} LIVE</span>\\n          {totalRequiresKey > 0 && (\\n            <span className=\\\"text-amber-400 font-medium\\\">({totalRequiresKey} KEY-REQ)</span>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Right Actions & Modals Triggers */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n        {/* Base Map Selector */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-slate-900 rounded-lg p-0.5 border border-slate-800\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setBaseMap(\'dark\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded transition-colors ${\\n              baseMap === \'dark\' \\n                ? \'bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-sm\' \\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n            title=\\\"Tactical Dark Basemap\\\"\\n          >\\n            Tactical\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setBaseMap(\'satellite\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded transition-colors ${\\n              baseMap === \'satellite\' \\n                ? \'bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-sm\' \\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n            title=\\\"High-Resolution Satellite Imagery\\\"\\n          >\\n            Satellite\\n          </button>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setBaseMap(\'terrain\')}\\n            className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded transition-colors ${\\n              baseMap === \'terrain\' \\n                ? \'bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-sm\' \\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n            title=\\\"Topographic Elevation\\\"\\n          >\\n            Topo\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Global Refresh Button */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onRefreshAll}\\n          disabled={isRefreshing}\\n          className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono transition-all disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n          title=\\\"Refresh All Live Feeds\\\"\\n        >\\n          <RefreshCw className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 ${isRefreshing ? \'animate-spin text-cyan-400\' : \'\'}`} />\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Refresh</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Source Health Modal Button */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onOpenHealth}\\n          className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono transition-all\\\"\\n          title=\\\"Inspect Source Status & Latency Matrix\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Server className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Health</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Repository Audit Report Button */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onOpenAudit}\\n          className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-950/60 hover:bg-indigo-900/80 border border-indigo-500/40 text-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-100 text-xs font-mono transition-all shadow-sm\\\"\\n          title=\\\"View Complete Reference Repositories Audit & Data-Source Registry\\\"\\n        >\\n          <FileText className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">Audit Report</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* Gemini Situational Briefing Button */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={onOpenBriefing}\\n          className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-900/60 to-blue-900/60 hover:from-cyan-800/80 hover:to-blue-800/80 border border-cyan-500/50 text-cyan-200 text-xs font-mono transition-all shadow-sm\\\"\\n          title=\\\"Generate AI Situational Geointelligence Briefing\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Cpu className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-300\\\" />\\n          <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline\\\">AI Briefing</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Header.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Header.tsx component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create tactical header component\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
