??God\342\200\231s Eye View \342\200\224 core 3D globe + aircraft/ships/satellites/cameras\nGitHub \342\200\224 bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view\nThis is the canonical repo and is currently on v0.1.1.\nWorldMonitor \342\200\224 global news + geopolitical + finance + infrastructure intelligence\nGitHub \342\200\224 WorldMonitor\nIt includes 3D/2D mapping, 45 data layers, finance radar, infrastructure and news aggregation.\nOpen Live Map \342\200\224 cleaner live-map implementation/reference\nGitHub \342\200\224 hendrikbgr/open-live-map\nGigawatt Map \342\200\224 power plants/data centres/infrastructure, particularly useful for ASTRA\nGitHub \342\200\224 Sudhendra/gigawattmap\nActive Fire Dashboard \342\200\224 NASA FIRMS wildfire/event layer\nGitHub \342\200\224 girubato/active_fire_dashboard\nOne warning: this repo currently contains a sample-data fallback when the backend fails, so AI Studio must explicitly remove/disable that behavior for production.\nTerriaJS \342\200\224 serious geospatial platform architecture for large numbers of layers\nGitHub \342\200\224 TerriaJS/terriajs\nIt supports Cesium 3D, 2D fallback and very large layer catalogs.\nDownload\nFor each page:\nCode \342\206\222 Download ZIP\nThen you\'ll have roughly:\ngods-eye-view-main.zip\nworldmonitor-main.zip\nopen-live-map-main.zip\ngigawattmap-main.zip\nactive_fire_dashboard-main.zip\nterriajs-main.zip\nThose are the six I would upload \n\n\n1. bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view\n2. deco31416/worldmonitor\n3. hendrikbgr/open-live-map\n4. NoahSBrown/Argus\n5. Sudhendra/gigawattmap\n6. girubato/active_fire_dashboard\n7. TerriaJS/terriajs\n8. TerriaJS/TerriaMap\n\nfull free hand no erros please get it sorted and ensure all dependencies are done if needed use free hand give me a whole end product \nso include all your suggestions already and make it work for a unified geospatial visualization platform that integrates all these data sources effectively."
