  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Visualizing Network Topology**\n\nI\'m now integrating a high-fidelity visualizer for subsea cables into `src/components/TacticalMap.tsx`. The goal is to represent global cable routes with detailed geometries, like those across the Atlantic and Pacific, and use an animated SVG gradient for a dynamic visual.\n\n\n**Developing Dynamic Map Layers**\n\nI\'ve been working on a new approach for map visualization and I am now focusing on satellite orbit ground tracks within the `satellitePropagator.ts` file and incorporating the `calculateGroundTrack` function. The recent work involves rendering illuminated polylines for active satellites, using a cyan dashed line for the past orbit and an emerald solid line for the projected future orbit. Also for aircraft, I\'m visualizing a 15-minute kinematic vector as a track projection. I am building the time simulation propagation of satellite positions so I can adjust these parameters in real-time.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
