  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved all compilation and functional errors across the **GOD-VIEW-LAB Geospatial Intelligence Platform** while strictly preserving the **NO FAKE DATA** policy and live telemetry connections.\n\n### Comprehensive Fixes & Capabilities\n\n- **Bit Path Visualizer & Infrastructure Routes**:\n  - Implemented trans-oceanic subsea fiber optic cable routes (e.g., MAREA, Grace Hopper, Trans-Pacific Express, Dunant, AEC-1) and global nuclear infrastructure nodes with selectable path inspection and bandwidth metrics.\n\n- **Dynamic Heat Map Layer**:\n  - Configured multi-mode density heatmaps (**Thermal Anomalies**, **Seismic Energy**, **Aviation Density**) with dynamic radius and blur weighting derived from live feed intensities.\n\n- **Tactical Alert Notification Center**:\n  - Activated automated real-time trigger evaluation for severe earthquakes ($M \\ge 4.0$), NASA EONET thermal anomalies, and breaking OSINT flashes.\n  - Included Web Audio synthesis chimes, toast popups, and quick-focus actions to navigate the camera directly to alert coordinates.\n\n- **4D Temporal Timeline Scrubber**:\n  - Added temporal scrubbing with $-24\\text{h}$ historical replay, $1\\times/10\\times/60\\times/300\\times$ simulation warp speeds, one-click return to live reception, and RainViewer Doppler radar frame scrubbing.\n\n- **OSINT Feed Filter & Verification**:\n  - Configured live filtering across GDELT Doc 2.0 and curated intelligence streams by category (**Military**, **Cyber**, **Disaster**, **Geopolitics**, **Maritime**) with instant keyword search and source attribution.\n\n- **Gemini 3.8 Flash Geospatial AI Engine**:\n  - Enabled multi-source AI threat assessment in the **AI Analyst Drawer** (synthesizing live flight counts, orbital coordinates, seismic clusters, and news).\n  - Integrated single-entity strategic analysis inside the **Object Detail Drawer** with risk scoring and situational briefing generation.\n\n- **Multi-Modal Data Exploration**:\n  - **Tactical Map**: Live 2D Leaflet rendering with SGP4 satellite ground-track orbits, flight velocity vectors, and radar tiles.\n  - **Analytics Dashboard**: High-density interactive charts (Seismic magnitude histograms, flight altitude distribution, satellite altitude vs. velocity scatter, OSINT thematic pie).\n  - **Live Grid Matrix**: Searchable tabular data matrix with full CSV export capabilities across all domains.\n  - **Orbital Pass Predictor**: Compute upcoming ground pass windows, azimuth angles, and maximum elevation for any tracked satellite over preset or custom observer coordinates."
    modified_response: "I have resolved all compilation and functional errors across the **GOD-VIEW-LAB Geospatial Intelligence Platform** while strictly preserving the **NO FAKE DATA** policy and live telemetry connections.\n\n### Comprehensive Fixes & Capabilities\n\n- **Bit Path Visualizer & Infrastructure Routes**:\n  - Implemented trans-oceanic subsea fiber optic cable routes (e.g., MAREA, Grace Hopper, Trans-Pacific Express, Dunant, AEC-1) and global nuclear infrastructure nodes with selectable path inspection and bandwidth metrics.\n\n- **Dynamic Heat Map Layer**:\n  - Configured multi-mode density heatmaps (**Thermal Anomalies**, **Seismic Energy**, **Aviation Density**) with dynamic radius and blur weighting derived from live feed intensities.\n\n- **Tactical Alert Notification Center**:\n  - Activated automated real-time trigger evaluation for severe earthquakes ($M \\ge 4.0$), NASA EONET thermal anomalies, and breaking OSINT flashes.\n  - Included Web Audio synthesis chimes, toast popups, and quick-focus actions to navigate the camera directly to alert coordinates.\n\n- **4D Temporal Timeline Scrubber**:\n  - Added temporal scrubbing with $-24\\text{h}$ historical replay, $1\\times/10\\times/60\\times/300\\times$ simulation warp speeds, one-click return to live reception, and RainViewer Doppler radar frame scrubbing.\n\n- **OSINT Feed Filter & Verification**:\n  - Configured live filtering across GDELT Doc 2.0 and curated intelligence streams by category (**Military**, **Cyber**, **Disaster**, **Geopolitics**, **Maritime**) with instant keyword search and source attribution.\n\n- **Gemini 3.8 Flash Geospatial AI Engine**:\n  - Enabled multi-source AI threat assessment in the **AI Analyst Drawer** (synthesizing live flight counts, orbital coordinates, seismic clusters, and news).\n  - Integrated single-entity strategic analysis inside the **Object Detail Drawer** with risk scoring and situational briefing generation.\n\n- **Multi-Modal Data Exploration**:\