  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the data ingest and fetch errors across the live telemetry feeds and hardened the system\'s network resilience:\n\n- **Extended Ingest Timeouts**: Increased the upstream request timeouts for OpenSky flight tracking, CelesTrak orbital TLEs, GDELT geopolitical dispatches, and USGS seismic feeds to accommodate heavy payloads without premature aborts.\n- **Graceful Stale Fallback & Auto-Recovery**: Implemented cached fallback snapshots and dual CelesTrak endpoint failovers so that transient network spikes or upstream rate limits seamlessly retain the latest verified data rather than throwing unhandled exceptions.\n- **Sanitized Data Identifiers & Defensive Parsing**: Sanitized ID hashes and guarded JSON response parsers across all client and backend layers to eliminate pattern mismatch exceptions."
    modified_response: "I have resolved the data ingest and fetch errors across the live telemetry feeds and hardened the system\'s network resilience:\n\n- **Extended Ingest Timeouts**: Increased the upstream request timeouts for OpenSky flight tracking, CelesTrak orbital TLEs, GDELT geopolitical dispatches, and USGS seismic feeds to accommodate heavy payloads without premature aborts.\n- **Graceful Stale Fallback & Auto-Recovery**: Implemented cached fallback snapshots and dual CelesTrak endpoint failovers so that transient network spikes or upstream rate limits seamlessly retain the latest verified data rather than throwing unhandled exceptions.\n- **Sanitized Data Identifiers & Defensive Parsing**: Sanitized ID hashes and guarded JSON response parsers across all client and backend layers to eliminate pattern mismatch exceptions."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
